WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.750
[On screen: “Describe the numbers in table 1.”]

00:02.750 --> 00:03.400
[Waiting time shortened]

00:03.418 --> 00:07.893
Table one summarizes the dataset and how it is divided
for model training and evaluation.

00:08.923 --> 00:13.229
Ten thousand eight hundred fifty-seven is the number
of samples remaining after preprocessing.

00:14.285 --> 00:18.503
Twenty-five is the number of input features:
the variables describing each sample.
